       "id": "1a.1",
       "text": "Aldan House, a residential building on Cobbett Row in Nerridge, collapsed on the morning of November 3, 2025.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.2",
       "text": "The collapse destroyed Aldan House together with its east wing and disrupted service at the building.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.3",
       "text": "Injuries were documented in Nerridge and the fire service rescued nine people within the first three hours.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "A warning was issued for Cobbett Row and Provincial Urban Search and Rescue was deployed to the site, with the cause not yet stated.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
